      'Matches Chapter 3 pp. 12 & 16: when m(t) is piecewise constant (pulse/square), dm/dt = 0 on plateaus so fi(t) = fc except at transitions; when m(t) ramps linearly (triangle), fi(t) shifts by a constant offset.',
